# role-backend — a thin COMPOSITE bundle for backend/service work (FETCHED-
# ONLINE, never baked). Composes primitives' members directly (no `#meta:requires`
# in the engine; pacman --needed dedupes). KEEP THIS SMALL.
#
# Source packs it mirrors:
#   • lang-go      → go, gopls, delve          (a common backend runtime)
#   • lang-python  → python-pipx, ruff         (the other common backend runtime;
#                                               uv is already baked)
#   • dev-cli      → httpie, xh                (API testing)
# Backend devs reach for containers too, but that stays its own `containers` pack
# (it has a rootless side effect) — a role bundle composes pure package members,
# not another pack's hooks.
#meta:type role
go
gopls
delve
python-pipx
ruff
httpie
xh

# Opt-in mise-managed runtimes for the two backend languages (same directives as
# the lang-go / lang-python primitives).
mise:go
mise:python
